    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d736-a1">

                <pb facs="0875" n="781" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg781"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No.
                    2588.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Julio Sanguily to
                        Mr. Williams.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Fortress Cabala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-08-20"><hi rendition="#italic">August 20,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir</hi>: Sick and under arrest in this fortress
                    without reason, I desire to be sent as soon as possible to the United States. My
                    case is identical with those of Carrillo, Ruiz, and Vargas, and I only ask what
                    was granted them.</p>
                <p>In this sense I address you the present, begging you to obtain from the Spanish
                    Government my transfer to the United States, and anticipating my thanks, I
                    remain,</p>
                <p>Yours, very truly,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Julio Sanguily.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
